WEBVTT

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.610
The sky!

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.670
Ex!

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.550
You okay, kid?!

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.920
I'm fine. What is this place?

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.930
Well, it's definitely not 
the Queen of Hearts' castle, but...

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:25.490
Welcome to the world of the Looking Glass,

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.410
Priestess of Tuning and company.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:28.560
You bastard!

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.250
That's what the Mad Hatter transformed into!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:35.260
The Mad Hatter was a false form
 I used in Wonderland.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.340
I am the Jabberwock!

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:38.690
The Jabberwock?

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.430
That's enough for introductions.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.700
Loki!

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:46.130
Alice!

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:47.760
Wait, I'm coming for you!

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:50.060
You cannot save her.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.030
Tao! Shane!

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:57.250
We're fine!

00:00:58.190 --> 00:00:59.260
I'm coming!

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:01.700
No! Don't worry about us!

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.590
But...!

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:04.240
We can handle this!

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.290
We'll meet up outside the forest!

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:07.370
Got it?

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:11.110
Reina, let's go.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:12.360
Hurry!

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.580
Wait!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.250
Now, let the fun and games begin!

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.780
A Fairy Tale Nobody Knows

00:02:57.970 --> 00:02:59.830
Wait! We need to go back!

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:02.230
We can't! I promised them!

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:03.460
They told me to take care of you!

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:04.590
Still!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.710
Tao said we'd meet up with outside the forest.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.420
And I believe in him and Shane!

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.140
Reina!

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.570
Yes... You're right.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.130
I can't die yet...

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.350
Not here... Not yet...

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:23.470
It's dangerous to stay here.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:24.340
Let's go.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:34.210
Are you cold?

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.820
Tao and Shane will be fine.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.500
They're waiting for us outside the forest.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.390
No...

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:41.270
Reina?

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:45.090
Those two won't go down so easily!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:48.370
When somebody dies, it happens instantly.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:50.780
It was that way for everybody.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:53.510
In my homeland...

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.660
And then with Aladdin...

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.310
Everyone vanishes in the blink of an eye...

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:01.290
leaving me behind all alone.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:08.010
But even so... I have to keep living.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:12.480
I don't want anyone else
 to go through what I had to!

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.770
So, in order to protect everyone...

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.030
I have to keep going forward.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:22.980
Even if I'm all alone, like I was
 when I began this journey.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:29.330
Reina, you'll never be alone again.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:32.570
I promise.

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:36.140
No matter what happens,
 I'll never leave you alone.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:41.340
I've seen lots of Story Zones now,

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.030
and there's something I've learned.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:44.710
Something you've learned?

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.080
No matter the fate they've been dealt,

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.810
everyone treasures the feelings they 
carry as they live out their lives.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:54.850
And if your feelings tell you 
to protect those people...

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.260
I'll be there to help you.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:04.060
I was born without one, but that's
 the role I really wanted to play.

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:06.780
Ex, thank you!

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.390
Because of you, I...

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.740
H-Hey!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.510
Tao! Shane!

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:17.220
Yeah, uh...

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.630
I saw nothing! I heard nothing!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.930
Right?

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:21.890
Right!

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:27.430
I definitely didn't see you two staring 
romantically into each other's eyes!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.760
Hey, don't say that!

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.430
Aw, come on, missy...

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.000
I'm so glad!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.170
I'm so glad you two are safe!

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:48.320
Sorry, boss... I didn't mean to worry you.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.600
Same to you.

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:55.490
No. Thanks, you guys.

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:57.480
What a tearful reunion!

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:00.220
My bunny ears turned bright red!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.060
March Hare?!

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.080
What? Did I do something wrong?

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.910
Actually, about that...

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:16.430
March, march! I'm marching through March!

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:19.540
'Cause I'm the March Hare!

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:22.870
And I'm a marching Hare!

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:26.840
Why do I get the feeling an 
all too familiar face just walked by?

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:31.280
She kept repeating the "March" part 
to make sure we'd recognize her.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:35.920
March, march, marching rabbit!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.960
Hey, March Hare!

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:41.170
Who are you? How do you know my name?

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:44.160
Who the hell do you think you're fooling?

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.270
No, wait a second.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.080
If this is a different Story Zone...

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.610
Then she's...

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:54.120
And while she was showing 
us through the forest,

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.340
we stumbled upon you guys.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:59.310
She looks just like the March Hare, though.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.120
Hey now! I <i>am</i> the March Hare!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:08.420
Actually, the Jabberwock said this 
was the Looking Glass Story Zone.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.710
I see.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:13.110
So this is the Looking Glass's March Hare.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.050
Hey, March Hare!

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:18.580
Do you know where the White Queen
 or the Red Queen are?

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.460
I sure do!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:23.050
I'm with the White Queen's army,

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:26.890
and lately this Jabber-whatsits monster
 has joined the Red Queen's army.

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:29.760
Things are looking really grim!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.450
Now we know where we're headed.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.070
Wait, what? What do you mean?

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:37.550
We're heading to the Red Queen's castle.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:39.180
Seriously?!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.440
Hey, March Hare.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:45.440
Who are these folks?

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.540
You!

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:50.770
Onigashima-style Shiatsu!

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:54.160
Wait, he's just like the March Hare!

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:57.760
So this is the Mad Hatter 
from this Story Zone?

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:59.470
I beg your pardon.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.170
Anyway, listen to this!

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:06.120
These folks say they're gonna go to the 
Red Queen's castle and beat her people up!

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:06.830
What?

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.170
We'll be cheering for you!

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.180
Wait, you're not coming?

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:13.200
Oh, I know.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:17.140
I'll do you a huge favor and draw you a map.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.540
You really aren't coming, are you?

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:26.640
I guess we missed our chance
 to sneak in under the cover of night.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.090
That's fine.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:32.670
Loki should know we're coming.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:33.940
That's right.

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:36.670
Loki's enjoying this battle.

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:38.200
He sees it as a game.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.540
Then...

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.530
Let's wipe that smirk off his face.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.160
I'm sure the four of us together can do it.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:49.000
Wh-What?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.830
You sure learned to talk big, kid.

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.620
I-I...

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.880
I just want to keep my promise to Reina.

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.870
Wonderland and the Looking Glass...

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.010
This battle stretches between two Story Zones.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:10.160
Let's do what the kid suggested 
and put an end to it!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:11.080
Yeah!

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:25.460
What is this place?

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.420
A chess board, maybe?

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:30.640
But it's weirdly quiet...

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.870
Don't let your guard down!

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.570
Who knows what they're up to?

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:38.120
Hello, everyone.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.900
We've been waiting.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:45.700
Welcome to the Red Queen's castle.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.890
It's good to see you again, Ex.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:49.810
Where is Alice?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:52.380
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:56.250
Alice!

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.280
Just wait, Alice.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.570
Before we fight, there's 
something I want to ask you.

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:02.840
What is it you're after?

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:05.230
Why are you spreading Chaos Tellers
 throughout the land?

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:08.930
The Church of Fortem has but one goal:

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:12.910
to free this world from the Storyteller.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.080
Free it?

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.880
You've seen it in many a Story Zone...

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:23.720
How insane the tales 
the Storyteller weaves are.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:27.070
The Story Zones are invisible birdcages.

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:31.850
To those with fates, and those without.

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:35.330
So you're creating 
Chaos Tellers to destroy them?

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:36.730
That's insane.

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:40.450
You're trampling on the feelings 
of the people who live there!

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.570
Trampling them?

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:47.120
Puppets of fate have no feelings.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:48.470
Curly...

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:49.790
You're wrong.

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.830
You're so wrong.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:56.160
It's impossible not to have 
feelings of your own.

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:02.840
So who are you really fighting for?

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:07.110
For the holders of blank books 
who are trapped in these cages.

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:10.440
You should all know what happens

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:13.760
to those with blank books.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:16.190
They suffer needlessly...

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:18.500
No, I'll be forthright.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:22.200
We suffer needlessly, and I'm fighting for us.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.500
We never asked you to do that.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.710
You want to destroy a Story Zone for <i>that?</i>

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.070
You're off your rocker.

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:32.430
What you're doing is unforgivable!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:37.380
The people who inhabit Story Zone
 <i>do</i> have feelings of their own!

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.290
And you have no right to trample them!

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.220
Goodness me...

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:46.130
Looks like there's no sense in talking more.

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:48.230
Kindly take care of them.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.240
Beware the Jabberwock!

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:54.380
The jaws that bite, the claws that catch!

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:58.560
Beware the Jubjub bird...

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.650
In accordance with my contract with Loki,

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.490
I will destroy you.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:05.580
Everybody ready?

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.120
Heck yeah!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:10.630
Time for the Tao family to kick some butt!

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:13.010
Let's do this.

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:14.080
Let's.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:17.410
For the sake of the feelings we carry 
for those we've met on our journey!

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:18.820
Alice!

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:20.820
John Silver!

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:22.520
Gerda!

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.600
Jeanne d'Arc!

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:26.580
Connect!

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:32.590
Justice is with us!

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:41.560
Jabberwock, why are you working with Loki?

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:48.250
I normally exist only within 
a poem in this Story Zone.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:53.540
To come out, I need many 
tellers and many listeners.

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:56.780
And that's why you wrecked two Story Zones?

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:59.220
That's right!

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:01.110
I won't lose!

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:08.060
When I absorb Alice,

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.380
I'll become the main character

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:12.930
of both Wonderland

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.700
and the world of the Looking Glass!

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:21.120
Can't you see this sky?

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:23.780
Both of the Story Zones 
are going to disappear!

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:29.110
His desire to exist in this world 
is so strong he doesn't even care!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.750
You're wasting your time.

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:43.700
Shane, aim for his eyes!

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:44.250
Got it!

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.820
Blizzard Heart!

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:55.070
Wonder Labyrinth!

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.670
We did it!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.770
Now! Do the tuning!

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:03.360
Right!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:04.730
My, my...

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:07.890
This is no good.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:09.370
Move!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.410
Or should we kick your ass, too?

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.570
You? Defeat me?

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:24.880
Have you all forgotten?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:28.590
I possess a blank book, as well.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:29.490
What?

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:30.050
Impossible.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:33.390
Oh, it's quite possible.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.440
Connect.

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:41.480
Is that Aladdin...?

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:44.290
Not just any Aladdin.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:47.200
You see, when the sultan
 attains everything he wants,

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.860
his next desire is to see 
his subjects writhe in despair.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.820
He's awakened to the power of chaos.

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:55.570
You could call him Chaos Aladdin.

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.700
You'll pay for this, Loki.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:01.120
For trampling on Aladdin's feelings...

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:08.090
Dance for my amusement, fools!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:11.430
The Sickness Called Ennui!

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.340
Everyone, hang in there!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:24.450
Excellent! That's what I want to see!

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.440
Blizzard Heart!

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:30.580
You fools cannot defeat me.

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:35.510
Enough.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:37.420
Let's end this.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:51.260
You humans made this harder 
than it needed to be.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.070
Take care of these fools.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.000
I'm only interested in...

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:00.490
How many times have you stood in my way?

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:02.790
But now it's all over.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:08.810
Reina, I...

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:12.520
I promised you...

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.650
Good grief. All right already...

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:20.740
If you want to keep your promise,

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:22.910
stand and call my name.

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:24.030
You're...

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:25.170
Yes.

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.370
My name is...

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.660
What's this?

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.500
Grimm...

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.680
Ludwig Grimm!

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.800
Ex?

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.850
Is that...

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.980
Now, let's get to work.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.950
I'm getting into this!

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:02.580
Im...possible!

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:11.590
That form... Just who are you?

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:13.670
Who can say?

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:21.100
Will you tell me your story?

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.130
I have no story to tell you!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.440
Everything I do, I do for Lady Curly!

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:32.180
The power of that wild crest, which can 
even connect to heroes yet unseen....

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:34.110
With that power...

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:40.070
Why don't you understand our grand ideals?!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.530
Stupid.

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:48.780
What's a story worth if you had 
to destroy someone to tell it?

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:53.010
It seems you've no intention
 of listening to me.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.010
The Sickness Called Ennui!

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:10.400
The Marchen Sisters Arrive Home!

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.410
The end!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.060
Thanks.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:25.320
Your story was good.

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.290
Ex!

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.310
You did it, kid!

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:37.750
I'm even more impressed than usual!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.730
What did you do?

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:43.880
I don't know. But I heard a voice...

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.510
A voice?

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:47.590
It said to me, "If you want
 to keep your promise, stand."

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:51.560
Filthy humans...

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:54.750
You could never understand...

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:59.690
the rage of a being that which
 only exists within poems...

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:03.220
You're right. I can't understand your anger.

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:05.670
But I do understand that you're lonely.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.910
Lonely? Me?

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:13.280
The sadness of being ignored by everyone 
is something I've tasted many times.

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.870
But now I have friends!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:21.250
People that share their feelings with me,
and people I can share my feelings with!

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:23.810
So to protect those feelings,

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.090
we're going to fight!

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:27.050
Friends...?

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:32.010
Is that what I need?

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:37.720
Wait, what about Alice?

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:40.570
Alice!

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:43.730
Alice!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:45.030
Reina!

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:46.370
Alice!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:59.150
Everyone, thank you so much

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:01.990
for saving me again and again.

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:03.220
Don't worry.

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.980
Yeah. This what we do on our journey.

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:10.540
This is really goodbye, isn't it?

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:11.220
Yeah.

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:15.680
But there are still stories
 I want to tell you.

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:19.110
If we meet again somewhere someday, I will!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.200
Really?

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:23.860
As long as you remember me.

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:27.750
Of course! I'll never forget you!

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:29.880
Thank makes me so happy, Alice.

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:37.440
Return this story to its proper form...

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:45.490
Teller of tales, 
drowned in a maelstrom of chaos...

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:49.630
By my words, I now begin the tuning...

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:05.150
Wonderland and the world
 of the Looking Glass...

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:07.920
We can finally say goodbye 
to Alice's Story Zones.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:11.470
You actually want to stay, don't you, missy?

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:13.390
Don't be stupid.

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:16.810
We hardly even know anything 
about the Church of Fortem yet.

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:21.490
So... um...

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:26.640
You'll all stay with me, won't you, everyone?

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:33.550
It's a little late for that, isn't it?

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:37.260
I told you already that
 I'll never let you be alone.

00:21:37.260 --> 00:21:40.540
We'll be following you 
whether you like it or not.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:44.040
Jeez! I get it already!

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:46.230
I'm sorry for asking something stupid.

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:50.650
Okay, let's get going, then!

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:55.270
Yeah! The Tao family begins 
a new journey, huh?

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:59.250
I know I've told you before that I never 
gave you permission to call us that!

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:01.110
Don't blush, missy!

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:02.570
I am not blushing!

00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:05.300
I'm used to this banter now, I guess.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:10.290
I guess you're not the new kid anymore, Ex.

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:12.210
What did you say?

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:14.200
Nothing.

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:18.370
Hey, Ex, what are you doing?

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:19.850
Sorry! Sorry!

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>When we're born, we're given a book.{EP1 final}</i>

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:46.270
<i>A script containing everything about us,
 the meaning of our lives... Everything.</i>

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:48.120
<i>"The Book of Fate."</i>

00:23:10.390 --> 00:23:15.910
<i>We follow these scripts written by 
an omniscient being known as the Storyteller,</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:23.250
<i>playing out the roles we're given from 
the day we're born until the day we die.</i>

00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:30.170
<i>So tell me...</i>

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:34.920
<i>When someone's Book of Fate
 is filled with nothing but blank pages,</i>

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:40.100
<i>what sort of role, what sort of fate,
 are they expected to play?{/EP1 final}</i>

00:23:43.420 --> 00:23:48.850
<i>Today, I think I found one answer.</i>
